  "adaptation": {
    "nativeTabs": "Real navigation.TabsRoot/List/Trigger/Content with automatic single selection, axis-only navigation, RTL, disabled skipping, active native region and current-build scopes. TabsMultiple remains single selection. Inactive builders unmount; application selection/query data survive.",
    "widths": "Docs dashboard/guide400DIP; translated docs384DIP; Create input512DIP maximum. Unspecified Create widths use400DIP native preview maximum. The two variant roots stay in a nonwrapping16DIP row with a bounded horizontal viewport. Source header rows retain a400/512DIP native minimum in a bounded horizontal viewport so the real input176DIP and opposite-edge controls remain reachable in narrow windows.",
    "layout": "Create body panels retain Vega24DIP padding and rounded-lg border, including the longer vertical Password/Notifications strings. Dashboard Cards retain all four original titles/descriptions/bodies in English/Arabic/Hebrew. Guide Usage has distinct plain text. Source input declares Reports content without a Reports trigger and that declaration is retained.",
    "sourceActions": "Only source Create input has an editable header. No extra panel notes/form fields are introduced. Action captures a local query/tab snapshot, without transport or an added Enter handler. More options uses real Settings/Export/Archive commands and only records local intent.",
    "menus": "Configuration/language and the source More menu follow Flyout/Native. Flyout is independent styled content; Native is an OS menu. Unspecified source dropdown content width uses192DIP fallback.",
    "icons": "Existing on-demand Material SVG equivalents; icon-only source triggers gain Home/Search/Settings native accessible names without displaying labels. No new font, icon font, image asset or dependency.",
    "disabled": "The fixed source requires one opacity50 layer. Compound and legacy native Tabs now disable automatic dim only when already applying explicit .5. Ancestor-disabled paths keep native dim and reject real input. Existing concentrated SDK flow covers enabled255/explicit128/ancestor128 for both APIs.",
    "lifetime": "Only strings/maps/counters and public desktop.MenuState persist. Current Context/Element/Scope/content callbacks are not retained by the application model.",
    "scope": "One public native-input flow and4 software PNGs. Real OS menu tracking, IME, AT, font metrics, scale/multi-display and full platform/visual matrix remain separate."
  }
